ter, fast+cheap) \u{2014} used for all requests first\nPROXY_WEBSHARE_URL=http://user:pass@proxy.webshare.io:80\n\n# DataImpulse (residential) \u{2014} fallback when Webshare gets blocked\nPROXY_DATAIMPULSE_URL=http://user:pass@gw.dataimpulse.com:823\n\n# =============================================================================\n# Optional Overrides\n# =============================================================================\n\n# CRAWLER_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=30.0\n# CRAWLER_MAX_SPIDER_PAGES=10\n# CRAWLER_USER_AGENT=Rekryon-Crawler/1.0\n\n# These are NOT needed on crawler machines (they run on the cloud/analysis machine):\n# - vLLM settings (VLLM_HOST, VLLM_PORT, CRAWLER_LLM_MODEL)\n# - Email settings (SMTP_*, AWS_*, EMAIL_*)\n# - Stripe settings (STRIPE_*)\n# - R2 storage settings (R2_*)\n# - Frontend URL\n# - SECRET_KEY\n\n# =============================================================================\n# Sentry Error Monitoring\n# =============================================================================\n# SENTRY_DSN=https://examplePublicKey@your-sentry-host/1\n# SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0.2\n";
